    {
      "id": "db57c9a8a5e34e9ea84e96fdfa94f59a8dd84117",
      "author": {
        "_account_id": 101,
        "name": "Lai Siyao",
        "email": "lai.siyao@whamcloud.com",
        "username": "laisiyao"
      },
      "date": "2026-10-30 13:09:22.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 4:\n\nAddressed in PS4:\n- the batching is reverted: the auto-split is queued by the getattr from\n  the \"stat\" (mdt_getattr_internal() is only reached with\n  MA_DIRENT_CNT via mdt_getattr_name_lock()), so creating in batches\n  would not have added the split traces.\n- the MDTs now get debug=+info+vfstrace for the test, restored with\n  stack_trap: D_INFO is what the default mask was missing, and\n  createmany() restores its saved mask (which now includes the flags).\n- the stale comment and the unlocal variables are gone with the\n  batching.",
      "accounts_in_message": [],
      "_revision_number": 4
    },
