          "tz": 480
        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "Lai Siyao",
          "email": "lai.siyao@whamcloud.com",
          "date": "2026-10-30 03:02:54.000000000",
          "tz": 480
        },
        "subject": "LU-20840 test: enable MDS debug in test_230q",
        "message": "LU-20840 test: enable MDS debug in test_230q\n\nThe directory auto-split of $tdir is queued by the getattr from the\n\"stat\" in the test loop, and is done by the restriper thread while\nwait_update() polls for the new stripe count.  When the split does\nnot complete in time (the long-standing LU-15844 \"stripe count 0 !=\n2\" failure), the dumped lctl dk logs contain no MDS traces, because\nthe auto-split messages are logged at D_INFO and D_VFSTRACE level,\nwhich the default mask doesn't include, and createmany() lowers the\nmask to debug=ha on all nodes when it creates more than 100 files.\n\nEnable the D_INFO and D_VFSTRACE flags on the MDTs for the duration\nof the test, and restore the original mask afterwards, so that a\nfailed split can be diagnosed from the test logs.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity mdscount=4 mdtcount=4 env=ONLY=230q,ONLY_REPEAT=10\nSigned-off-by: Lai Siyao <lai.siyao@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: Augment:DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I4e8b665696d247159bc8eca5484f30a3ca13c7fc\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
